  "description": "Device integrity for .NET apps on Android and iOS: a key the app never exports, signed measurements of the phone and of the app running on it, and a proof on each request -- and, if you turn them on, a second key the person unlocks to approve a request, and a PIN your backend checks. It never scores and never decides: your backend does.",
